  "current-post-image-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/649c2588433fb54b2b5f35b8_Screenshot%202023-06-26%20at%2010.50.22.avif",
  "current-post-image-sizes": "100vw",
  "current-post-image-srcset": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/649c2588433fb54b2b5f35b8_Screenshot%202023-06-26%20at%2010.50.22-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/649c2588433fb54b2b5f35b8_Screenshot%202023-06-26%20at%2010.50.22.avif 1200w",
  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/649c254f2b64748805cc3463_logo%20smash%20smash.webp\")",
  "title-post-2": "How Smash Smash became a management ace thanks to Innovorder",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TQtlNEauMGQ\" title=\"Smash Smash X Innovorder\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>As a Smash Smash franchisee in Bordeaux, Guillaume has set up his restaurant on Rue Sainte-Catherine, Europe's biggest pedestrian street (18,000 pedestrians/day)!&nbsp;</p>\n          <p>Her challenge? To manage his point of sale as effectively as possible, so as to attract the maximum number of customers and serve them on time. To achieve this, he turned to Innovorder.&nbsp;</p>\n          <h4>Its average shopping basket is 30% higher</h4>\n          <p>By installing a <a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\">kiosk</a>, not only has he streamlined order-taking and relieved an employee who can concentrate on service and cooking, but he has also boosted his average basket.&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><em>\"On average, the average basket is 30% higher at the kiosk than at the till, because the cashier doesn't always have time to offer a dessert or a menu, which the kiosk systematically does.\"&nbsp;</em></p>\n          <h4>The touch-sensitive cash register has become his restaurant's control tower&nbsp;</h4>\n          <p>Guillaume relies on his <a href=\"/en/point-of-sales-restaurant\">Innovorder cash register</a> to automatically receive all his orders (terminal, delivery and click &amp; collect). The cash register collects all orders in a single location, and provides an overview of all the metrics essential for running the restaurant.</p>\n          <h4>His favorite feature: the Heat Map</h4>\n          <p>Guillaume loves Innovorder's Heat Map because it enables him to track his sales by day and by hour at a glance, and thus to manage his payroll correctly according to his activity.</p>\n          <p>-</p>\n          <p>Do you run a fast-food outlet? Call in an Innovorder expert and find out how to streamline your business and boost your profitability!</p>\n          <p>👉 <a href=\"/en/commercial-catering/franchise\"><strong>Discover our expertise for franchises!</strong></a></p>\n        ",
  "right-head": "Smash Smash",
  "bozzolo-cat": "Franchise",
  "div-html": "\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5975dd1a0229_Borne%20de%20commande.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Self Ordering Kiosk</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/point-of-sales-restaurant\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc596eea1a0225_Portefeuille-2.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Cash register</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/online-ordering-for-restaurant\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59e0dd1a0228_Commande%20en%20ligne.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Online Ordering</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/kitchen-display-system\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc595abf1a0222_%C3%A9cran%20de%20production.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Kitchen Display System</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                ",
